{"3179120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Monastery: Ora et Labora", "steam_appid": 3179120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Wishlist and follow us!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179120/extras/514444e6dec76993e43689e5f530f6ec.avif?t=1787065460\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179120/extras_big/514444e6dec76993e43689e5f530f6ec.avif?t=1787065460 width=800 height=220 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Join our Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179120/extras/42ebdaf0b12649ebc1d3a49be8538505.avif?t=1787065460\" width=1600 height=300 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monastery: Ora et Labora</strong> is a management game where you build and manage a medieval monastery. As the newly appointed abbot, your journey begins in a peaceful medieval monastery, where you’ll guide your monks through the sacred rule of &quot;Ora et Labora&quot;— pray and work. Oversee their daily lives as they perform divine offices, brew the finest ales, and illuminate intricate manuscripts, all while carefully managing the monastery's resources. Face the trials of medieval life, from harsh weather to the looming threat of war, and make critical decisions to safeguard your community's future. Customize and expand your monastery, meet the needs of your growing brotherhood, and become a beacon of hope in a world seeking guidance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179120/extras/36b51f583da2b1c2713f31674b80feda.webp?t=1787065460\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179120/extras/89d018594b52c0659e02be35d3666bf2.poster.avif?t=1787065460\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179120/extras/89d018594b52c0659e02be35d3666bf2.webm?t=1787065460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179120/extras/89d018594b52c0659e02be35d3666bf2.mp4?t=1787065460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oversee the monastery’s vital resources, including food, water, herbs, and tools. Balance the production and consumption of these resources to ensure the community thrives, all while adhering to the monastic values of simplicity and self-sufficiency.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179120/extras/327c6fdfa01aafbe2a8ad8e4580ad85a.webp?t=1787065460\" width=600 height=60 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179120/extras/f586aa6e89842c2b0a87c8719738adab.poster.avif?t=1787065460\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179120/extras/f586aa6e89842c2b0a87c8719738adab.webm?t=1787065460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179120/extras/f586aa6e89842c2b0a87c8719738adab.mp4?t=1787065460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Expand and personalize your monastery by constructing new rooms and adding decorative elements. Each addition not only enhances the monastery’s functionality but also reflects the spiritual beauty and tranquility of monastic life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179120/extras/dc1193694d30a055904460ba0c965c41.webp?t=1787065460\" width=600 height=60 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179120/extras/5898066d2a13c93d7e651244bb6b3a21.poster.avif?t=1787065460\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179120/extras/5898066d2a13c93d7e651244bb6b3a21.webm?t=1787065460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179120/extras/5898066d2a13c93d7e651244bb6b3a21.mp4?t=1787065460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Lead your monks in prayer to influence life in the monastery and the world around it. Devoted prayers can prevent bad events, bring good fortune, and create a positive atmosphere. By focusing on prayer, you can help guide the community toward peace and prosperity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179120/extras/9cd5cff27dd60b16ea1a77edf6d24494.webp?t=1787065460\" width=600 height=60 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179120/extras/ccf590501320038170517a32a0c2be9e.poster.avif?t=1787065460\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179120/extras/ccf590501320038170517a32a0c2be9e.webm?t=1787065460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source sr